&lt;h2&gt;PromeFTP 1.0.0 is now stable&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use SSH terminals and transfer files from one workspace on your Mac.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferences in one place&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Press ⌘, to manage appearance, updates, OpenSSH config, PAM answers, and terminal settings. About shows the running version and build.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Choose a terminal font&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pick an installed monospace font or enter a family name. Preview the result before saving.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep more terminal output&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Turn on Unlimited scrollback under Terminal to retain output for the current session. The finite line limit is still available.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring back a workspace&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Save selected tabs and their split layouts. Open them alongside current sessions, then use side-by-side SFTP or split SSH as usual.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active SSH, SFTP, and local shells before updating. Existing settings carry over. Requires macOS 13 or later and Apple Silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.0.0"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
